Poison resistance does come quickly, but it is an annoying insteadeath
that might happen. However, I am of the firm belief that dying
with an early wand in hand is Just Wrong. Wish for the amulet of
lifesaving. Whatever stupid thing happens, you won't die. If you burn
it, _wish for another one_.  Your goal is to get to the Castle and get
the next wand, not to carry wishes in your bag. Burn your resources,
you get more.

If you get a _single wish_, wishing up MR and hoping for reflection from
Soko (or even Medusa_ is 100% the way to go. If you have five to seven
wishes, it's not the best play. Just get MR and reflection. You won't
have to deal with finishing Soko 4 if you don't want to. 

